Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard: sun moving along its daily path, moon at night

The sun rises on the left at sunrise, is highest at solar noon and sets on
the right at sunset (times from the OpenDTU location); at night a crescent
moon moves from sunset to the next sunrise. Updated with every refresh.

