Subject: [PATCH] History from the SD card: older days, curves and recovery

- GET /api/history/power?date=YYYY-MM-DD: power curve of any day logged on
  the card (5 minute slots, short gaps filled)
- GET /api/history/days?from=&to=: daily totals from /fusion/dni.csv
- /api/history: sd.mounted and sd.first (oldest day on the card)
- dashboard: day / week / month / year navigation goes back to the oldest
  day on the card; totals older than the 62 days in flash come from the card
- empty history in flash (e.g. after a full flash erase): days, months and
  years are rebuilt from dni.csv once the card is mounted

